{"created": "2026-05-08T04:03:26.940583+00:00", "modified": "2026-05-08T04:03:27.210970+00:00", "id": 20077393, "conceptrecid": "20077392", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20077393", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.20077392", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20077393", "metadata": {"title": "Field-scale paddy rice and soybean yield data in China", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20077393", "publication_date": "2026-05-08", "description": "<div>Field yield data for rice were acquired via field surveys conducted by the Jiangsu Academy of Agricultural Sciences in November 2023, covering a total of 66 plots. For each surveyed field, five 1 m &times; 1 m sampling quadrats were set up to manually record spikes numbers. Subsequently, grain count per spike and 1000-grain weight were determined through laboratory testing.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Soybean yield data from 30 experimental fields were collected by the Chinese Academy of Agricultural Sciences in November 2024, encompassing planting density, seed quantity per individual plant, and 100-seed weight.&nbsp;<br><br></div>\n<div>The yield data is stored in the attribute field <em>Y_kgmu</em>, with the unit of kg/mu.</div>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Qiu, Lin", "affiliation": "Jiangsu Academy of Agricultural Sciences"}, {"name": "Wu, Shangrong", "affiliation": "Beijing Normal University"}, {"name": "Cao, Hong", "affiliation": "Chinese Academy of Agricultural Sciences"}, {"name": "Wang, Cong", "affiliation": "Chinese Academy of Agricultural Sciences"}, {"name": "Li, Anqi", "affiliation": "Beijing Normal University"}], "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "20077392"}}]}}, "title": "Field-scale paddy rice and soybean yield data in China", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/20077393", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/20077393?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20077393", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20077393", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.20077393", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077392", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/20077392", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20077392", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.20077392", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:20077393/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:20077393/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/20077393/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20077393/requests"}, "updated": "2026-05-08T04:03:27.210970+00:00", "recid": "20077393", "revision":